<box.text>
Here are the answers to yours anonymous feedback:
```
Q: The ability to see card abilities without having to add/remove them from the deck.
A: You say, and you have; I will add an button to start a carousel with cards something like in Witcher 3 ui to see all card you have in your deck

Q: Always the same soundtrack?
A: The soundtrack changes in a 24-hour rotation, each day, different one or at least it should be, during moon event also "waiting" music will be more _spooky_
A': Please note that custom server have at botton of json keys for "tavern & match ost", correct value is youtube video id, any video id, do with this information what you want

Q: Starter deck
A: Yeah, they are bit buggy and randomly generated each time you load game, becuause i had few issues wich them while adding and fixing cards (also I see now that few of them have empty config array, i will fill it now)

Q: Leader cards?
A: We have all leader cards from Witcher 3 and also few custom ones, you can change leader by clicking leader card in middle of deck maker

Q: -BUG-
A: Harvest festival card should not be resurrectable, thanks for bug report, i guess game still thinks they units

Q: New Faction?
A: It would be a nice challange, maybe, I could use some help wich it for idea, but why not if I can
```
Total answers when I am writing this: (**1**)
~DrMineword, last update: never
-# Our discord server is always open for any question and feedback
</box.text>


